---
import { scryerPreview } from "../data/scryer-preview";
---

<section class="scryer-access" id="scryer-access" aria-labelledby="scryer-access-title">
  <div class="access-header">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Scryer, served by Stithy · public research access</p>
      <div class="access-title-line">
        <h3 id="scryer-access-title"><a href="/scryer/">Try Scryer</a></h3>
        <span class="access-title-note" aria-hidden="true">←&#xFE0E; press to learn more!</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="version-status" aria-label="Live Scryer release metadata" hidden>
      <span id="scryer-live-version" aria-live="polite"></span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="access-intro">Both tokens can use every <code>wolf.scryer.*</code> tool. The choice is whether your input gets saved.</p>
  <div class="access-connection" aria-labelledby="scryer-connect-title">
    <div class="connection-heading">
      <h4 id="scryer-connect-title">Connect your MCP client</h4>
      <span class="connection-scratch" aria-hidden="true">client ─MCP→ S</span>
    </div>
    <p>Add the URL below as a remote MCP server. For its request header, use <code>Authorization: Bearer &lt;one of the tokens below&gt;</code>.</p>
    <div class="connection-url"><code id="scryer-mcp-url">{scryerPreview.endpoint}</code><button type="button" class="copy-key" data-key="scryer-mcp-url" aria-label="Copy Scryer MCP server URL">Copy URL</button></div>
  </div>
  <div class="access-tiers">
    <div class="access-tier">
      <div class="tier-heading"><h4>Base</h4><span class="tier-tag">question text not kept</span></div>
      <div class="tier-scratch" aria-hidden="true"><span>q</span><i>↦</i><span>∅</span><em>[discard]</em></div>
      <p>Every Scryer tool, with a 30-second deadline and a shared compute budget. Stithy counts and times each call without storing your question.</p>
      <div class="credential"><code id="scryer-base-key">{scryerPreview.baseKey}</code><button type="button" class="copy-key" data-key="scryer-base-key" aria-label="Copy base research bearer token">Copy</button></div>
    </div>
    <div class="access-tier contributor">
      <div class="tier-heading"><h4>Contributor</h4><span class="tier-tag">question text kept</span></div>
      <div class="tier-scratch contributor-scratch" aria-hidden="true"><span>q</span><i>↦</i><span>𝒟</span><em>[kept]</em></div>
      <p>Your full input is saved to help improve Scryer. You get a 120-second deadline, more memory and higher queue priority.</p>
      <div class="credential"><code id="scryer-contributor-key">{scryerPreview.contributorKey}</code><button type="button" class="copy-key" data-key="scryer-contributor-key" aria-label="Copy contributor research bearer token">Copy</button></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="warning">The tokens may be revoked if they're abused.</p>
  <p class="key-request">want your own token? <a href="/contact?project=scryer">contact me</a></p>
  <p class="access-foot">Once connected, your MCP client can list Scryer's tools. Stithy logs the tool, timing and outcome of every call. It doesn't log IP addresses. Base discards the input. Contributor keeps it. Seeing where Scryer gets stuck helps guide the work.</p>
</section>

<style>
  .scryer-access { grid-column: 1 / -1; min-width: 0; scroll-margin-top: 8rem; border: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-text-rgb) / .13); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: clamp(1rem, 2.4vw, 1.5rem); padding-bottom: clamp(1.4rem, 2.7vw, 1.7rem); background: rgb(var(--color-text-rgb) / .025); }
  .access-header { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: .8rem 1.2rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .eyebrow { font-size: .65rem; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; opacity: .55; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 .25rem; }
  .access-title-line { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: .35rem .65rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  h3 { font-size: 1.06rem; font-weight: 650; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0; }
  h3 a { color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: transparent; text-underline-offset: .18em; transition: text-decoration-color var(--duration-fast) var(--ease-out); }
  h3 a:hover { text-decoration-color: rgb(var(--color-text-rgb) / .45); }
  .access-title-note { color: rgb(var(--chromatic-cyan) / .35); font-family: var(--font-casual); font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: .02em; line-height: 1; transform: rotate(-2deg); pointer-events: none; user-select: none; }
  .version-status { position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%; overflow: hidden; border-block: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-text-rgb) / .1); border-left: 2px solid rgb(87 200 173 / .34); padding: .3rem .55rem .28rem .62rem; background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(87 200 173 / .045), transparent 68%); box-shadow: inset 0 1px rgb(255 255 255 / .018), inset 0 -1px rgb(0 0 0 / .28); color: rgb(var(--color-text-rgb) / .68); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: clamp(.6rem, 2.4vw, .68rem); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; letter-spacing: .025em; white-space: nowrap; }
  .version-status[hidden] { display: none; }
  .version-status[data-live]::after { content: ""; position: absolute; top: -42%; bottom: -42%; left: -44%; width: 34%; border-radius: 42% 58% 47% 53% / 34% 62% 38% 66%; background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 46% 50%, rgb(136 238 204 / .24) 0 18%, rgb(87 200 173 / .14) 42%, transparent 74%); filter: blur(.55px); transform: skewX(-9deg) scaleX(.42); transform-origin: center; animation: scryer-status-sheen 24s infinite; pointer-events: none; }
  .access-intro { font-size: .84rem; line-height: 1.55; opacity: .72; margin: .85rem 0 1.05rem; max-width: 70ch; }
  .access-connection { margin-bottom: .8rem; padding: .85rem; border: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-text-rgb) / .11); border-radius: .7rem; }
  .connection-heading { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: .5rem 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .access-connection h4 { margin: 0 0 .3rem; }
  .connection-scratch, .tier-scratch { color: rgb(var(--chromatic-cyan) / .34); font-family: var(--font-casual); font-weight: 400; pointer-events: none; user-select: none; }
  .connection-scratch { margin-right: .25rem; font-size: .78rem; letter-spacing: .025em; transform: rotate(-2deg); }
  .access-connection p { margin: 0 0 .65rem; font-size: .8rem; line-height: 1.55; opacity: .74; }
  .connection-url { display: flex; align-items: stretch; gap: .4rem; min-width: 0; }
  .connection-url code { min-width: 0; flex: 1; padding: .48rem .55rem; border: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-text-rgb) / .09); border-radius: .4rem; background: rgb(var(--color-text-rgb) / .04); font: .7rem/1.45 ui-monospace, Consolas, monospace; overflow-wrap: anywhere; user-select: all; }
  .access-tiers { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: .7rem; }
  .access-tier { min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .55rem; border: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-text-rgb) / .11); border-radius: .7rem; padding: .85rem; background: rgb(var(--color-text-rgb) / .025); }
  .access-tier.contributor { border-color: rgb(var(--color-text-rgb) / .18); }
  .tier-heading { display: flex; gap: .35rem .65rem; align-items: baseline; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .tier-scratch { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: .36rem; width: fit-content; margin: -.16rem 0 -.1rem auto; font-size: .76rem; transform: rotate(-2deg); }
  .tier-scratch i { color: rgb(var(--chromatic-cyan) / .2); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-style: normal; }
  .tier-scratch em { color: rgb(var(--color-text-rgb) / .28); font-size: .86em; font-style: normal; white-space: nowrap; }
  .contributor-scratch { color: rgb(var(--chromatic-red) / .31); transform: rotate(1.5deg); }
  .contributor-scratch i { color: rgb(var(--chromatic-red) / .19); }
  h4 { margin: 0; font-size: .88rem; font-weight: 650; }
  .tier-tag { font-size: .73rem; opacity: .72; }
  .access-tier p { font-size: .8rem; line-height: 1.55; opacity: .74; margin: 0; flex: 1; }
  .credential { display: flex; align-items: stretch; gap: .4rem; min-width: 0; margin-top: .25rem; }
  .credential code { min-width: 0; flex: 1; padding: .48rem .55rem; border: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-text-rgb) / .09); border-radius: .4rem; background: rgb(var(--color-text-rgb) / .04); font: .7rem/1.45 ui-monospace, Consolas, monospace; overflow-wrap: anywhere; user-select: all; }
  .copy-key { align-self: stretch; padding: .3rem .55rem; border: 1px solid rgb(var(--color-text-rgb) / .2); border-radius: .4rem; background: transparent; color: inherit; cursor: pointer; font-size: .7rem; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3; font-family: inherit; min-width: 3.7rem; }
  .copy-key:hover, .copy-key:focus-visible { background: rgb(var(--color-text-rgb) / .1); }
  .copy-key:focus-visible, a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid currentColor; outline-offset: 2px; }
  .warning { display: inline-block; margin: 1.2rem 0 .7rem; color: #ead5d8; font-size: .79rem; font-weight: 650; line-height: 1.5; letter-spacing: .01em; text-shadow: -1px 0 rgba(255,70,102,.55), 1px 0 rgba(57,215,246,.55); }
  .key-request { width: fit-content; margin: 0 0 .7rem; color: #dbcdea; font-size: .79rem; font-weight: 650; line-height: 1.5; letter-spacing: .01em; text-shadow: -1px 0 rgba(120,81,169,.82), 1px 0 rgba(155,114,207,.64); }
  .key-request a { color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: rgba(120,81,169,.78); text-underline-offset: .18em; }
  .key-request a:hover { text-decoration-color: currentColor; }
  .access-foot { margin: 0; font-size: .78rem; line-height: 1.55; opacity: .72; }
  .access-foot a { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 2px; }
  code { font-family: ui-monospace, Consolas, monospace; }
  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .access-tiers { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
    .connection-url { flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .connection-url code { flex-basis: 100%; }
    .connection-scratch { margin-left: auto; }
  }
  @keyframes scryer-status-sheen {
    0%, 58% { left: -44%; opacity: 0; transform: skewX(-9deg) scaleX(.42); }
    62% { left: -41%; opacity: .16; transform: skewX(-8deg) scaleX(.48); animation-timing-function: cubic-bezier(.18, .42, .28, 1); }
    70% { left: -25%; opacity: .36; transform: skewX(-6deg) scaleX(.7); animation-timing-function: cubic-bezier(.2, .55, .25, 1); }
    77% { left: 18%; opacity: .5; transform: skewX(-13deg) scaleX(1.24); animation-timing-function: cubic-bezier(.3, 0, .24, 1); }
    84% { left: 70%; opacity: .3; transform: skewX(-7deg) scaleX(.88); animation-timing-function: cubic-bezier(.32, 0, .4, 1); }
    90% { left: 112%; opacity: 0; transform: skewX(-4deg) scaleX(.58); }
    100% { left: 112%; opacity: 0; transform: skewX(-4deg) scaleX(.58); }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .version-status[data-live]::after { animation: none; opacity: 0; }
  }
</style>

<script>
  function bootScryerAccess() {
    const access = document.getElementById('scryer-access');
    if (access && window.location.hash === '#scryer-access') {
      window.requestAnimationFrame(() => access.scrollIntoView({ block: 'start' }));
    }
    const version = document.getElementById('scryer-live-version');
    const base = document.getElementById('scryer-base-key');
    if (!version || !base) return;
    const holder = version.closest<HTMLElement>('.version-status');
    const token = base.textContent?.trim();
    if (!token) return;
    const controller = new AbortController();
    const timeout = window.setTimeout(() => controller.abort(), 7000);
    fetch('https://mcp.woflo.dev/stithy/docs', {
      headers: { Authorization: `Bearer ${token}` },
      signal: controller.signal,
      cache: 'no-store',
    }).then(async response => {
      if (!response.ok) throw new Error('Live docs unavailable');
      const text = await response.text();
      const rows = [...text.matchAll(/^\|\s*\[`wolf\.scryer\.(?:ask|check|verify)`\]\([^)]+\)\s*\|\s*(\d+\.\d+\.\d+(?:[-+][\w.-]+)?)\s*\|/gm)];
      const versions = new Set(rows.map(row => row[1]));
      const routeCount = text.match(/Exact mathematics and science across (\d+) routes\./)?.[1];
      const snapshot = text.match(/Snapshot (\d+) of the Scryer engine/)?.[1];
      if (rows.length !== 3 || versions.size !== 1 || !routeCount || !snapshot) throw new Error('Scryer release metadata incomplete');
      version.textContent = `Scryer v${rows[0][1]} · snapshot ${snapshot} · ${routeCount} routes · ${rows.length} tools`;
      if (holder) holder.hidden = false;
      holder?.setAttribute('data-live', '');
      holder?.setAttribute('title', 'Live metadata for ask, check and verify');
    }).catch(() => { if (holder) holder.hidden = true; })
      .finally(() => window.clearTimeout(timeout));

    document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('.copy-key').forEach(button => {
      const defaultLabel = button.textContent || 'Copy';
      button.addEventListener('click', async () => {
        const key = document.getElementById(button.dataset.key || '')?.textContent?.trim();
        if (!key) return;
        try {
          if (navigator.clipboard && window.isSecureContext) {
            await navigator.clipboard.writeText(key);
          } else {
            const field = document.createElement('textarea');
            field.value = key;
            field.style.position = 'fixed';
            field.style.opacity = '0';
            document.body.appendChild(field);
            field.select();
            const copied = document.execCommand('copy');
            field.remove();
            if (!copied) throw new Error('Copy unavailable');
          }
          button.textContent = 'Copied';
        } catch {
          button.textContent = button.dataset.key === 'scryer-mcp-url' ? 'Select URL' : 'Select token';
          const range = document.createRange();
          const node = document.getElementById(button.dataset.key || '');
          if (node) { range.selectNodeContents(node); window.getSelection()?.removeAllRanges(); window.getSelection()?.addRange(range); }
        }
        window.setTimeout(() => { button.textContent = defaultLabel; }, 2000);
      });
    });
  }
  document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', bootScryerAccess);
</script>
